   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\">\n  <li>Jonah started the month with $40 and earned $15 each week walking dogs for neighbors. How much does he have after <span data-math=\"w\">w</span>&nbsp; weeks?</li>\n</ol>",
